# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BiDi Browser MCP — .gitignore (DEV branch)
# Branch policy: dev tracks everything main has PLUS _archive/
# (dev-only plans/research/diagnosis), .research/ (active analysis
# being written now; parked under _archive/ when done), .githooks/
# (pre-commit guard + installer), and agent guides. None of those
# ship to main — the promote workflow strips them at merge time.
# See root AGENTS.md → "Branch policy".
# (Main branch uses the same filename with different content —
#  _archive/, .research/, .githooks/ ignored there.)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Dependencies (never commit) ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ── Build output (never commit; releases ship dist/ via CI) ──
dist/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# ── Temp / scratch ──
temp/
tmp/
.temp/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Prompts / planning docs (local-only) ──
.prompts/

# ── Audit/summary files (never commit) ──
PHASE_*
*_AUDIT*
*_SUMMARY*

# ── Test / debug output ──
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
**/*.py[cod]
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/

# ── Local secrets (never commit) ──
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ── OS files ──
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini

# ── Local agent/tool state (never commit) ──
# Patterns mirror the hardened userscripts repo convention
.omo/
**/.omo/
**/.codegraph/
**/.taco/
**/.opencode/
**/.opencode-cache/
**/.codex/
**/.continue/
**/.kilocode/
**/.roo/
**/.qoder/
**/.trae/
**/.claude/
**/.gemini/
**/.cursor/
**/.windsurf/
**/.aider*
**/.muse/
**/opencode.log

# ── Local editor / IDE state (never commit) ──
.vscode/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.history/
**/.vs/
